    "IGUI_TienSkillMastery_Info": "<CENTRE> <SIZE:medium> Mastery <LINE> <LINE> <SIZE:small> <LEFT> A skill at level 10 keeps earning experience as mastery, levels 1 to 10. Each mastery level gives a tenth of the skill's mastery bonuses; mastery 10 is about a fifth better than skill level 10. Past mastery 10, experience still counts as prestige, with no further bonuses. <LINE> <LINE> Only experience counts, never reading. Strength and Fitness lose mastery before they lose a level. Mastery belongs to the character and is gone when it dies. <LINE> <LINE> Click a skill to see its bonuses now and at mastery 10.",
